{"id":28936,"section":"officeHoldings","status":"live","title":"Joe Messina — School Board Member, William S. Hart Union High School District","person":"#26549 Joe Messina","body":"#21588 William S. Hart Union High School District","office":"#26964 School Board Member","seatLabel":"Trustee Area 5","termStart":"2022-12","termEnd":"2026-12","selectionMethod":"","howEnded":"serving","startEvidence":"certified","provenance":"record_hart_superintendents_and_board_2026_10_04.php, 4 October 2026: from the Hart district's own pages","hits":["William S. Hart Union High School District, \"Governing Board Member Info,\" https://www.hartdistrict.org/apps/pages/governing-board-members, read 4 October 2026: \"Joe Messina Trustee Area No. 5 representative President\"; \"current term 2022 - 2026.\" How the term was won (an election, or appointment in lieu of one) is not yet held."],"noteHit":null}
{"id":28889,"section":"officeHoldings","status":"live","title":"David Powell — School Board Member, Saugus Union School District","person":"#28868 David Powell","body":"#21592 Saugus Union School District","office":"#26964 School Board Member","seatLabel":"Trustee Area 4","termStart":"2016-12","termEnd":"2020-12","selectionMethod":"appointed","howEnded":"expired","startEvidence":"certified","provenance":"apply_cancelled_2013_2016.php, 3 October 2026: a seat filled by appointment in lieu of election, on the County's list of cancelled elections (decision 6)","hits":["Appointed in lieu of election; no contest was held. The County cancelled the election of November 8, 2016 for Trustee Area 4 for want of candidates; its list of the candidates whose names would not appear on the ballot names David C. Powell, \"Appointed Incumbent\", for it (County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"General Election, November 8, 2016: Final List of Cancelled Elections, Appointment in Lieu of Election Due to Insufficiency of Candidates\", https://www.lavote.gov/Documents/Election_Info/11082016-Cancelled-Elections.pdf; and County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"2016 General Election: Final List of Qualified Candidates Whose Name Will Not Appear on the Ballot\", September 2, 2016, https://www.lavote.gov/Documents/Election_Info/11082016-final-list-qualified-candidates-who-will-not-appear-on-the-ballot.pdf).","Elections Code, section 10515: where no more candidates file than there are seats, the Board of Supervisors appoints them, and they serve exactly as if elected. The County calls this appointment in lieu of election."],"noteHit":null}
{"id":28887,"section":"officeHoldings","status":"live","title":"Michael Owen Lambarth — School Board Member, Castaic Union School District","person":"#28866 Michael Owen Lambarth","body":"#21596 Castaic Union School District","office":"#26964 School Board Member","seatLabel":"","termStart":"2015-12","termEnd":"2016-09-01","selectionMethod":"appointed","howEnded":"resigned","startEvidence":"certified","provenance":"apply_cancelled_2013_2016.php, 3 October 2026: a seat filled by appointment in lieu of election, on the County's list of cancelled elections (decision 6)","hits":["Appointed in lieu of election; no contest was held. The County cancelled the election of November 3, 2015 for the district's two at-large seats for want of candidates; its list of the candidates whose names would not appear on the ballot names Michael Owen Lambarth and Stacy Dobbs, neither of them an incumbent (County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"Local and Municipal Consolidated Elections, November 3, 2015: Final List of Cancelled Elections (Appointment in Lieu of Election Due to Insufficiency of Candidates)\", https://www.lavote.gov/Documents/Election_Info/11032015-CancelledElections.pdf; and County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"Local and Municipal Consolidated Elections, November 3, 2015: Final List of Qualified Candidates Whose Name Will Not Appear on the Ballot\", September 1, 2015, https://www.lavote.gov/Documents/Election_Info/11032015_CandidatesNotOnBallot.pdf).","Elections Code, section 10515: where no more candidates file than there are seats, the Board of Supervisors appoints them, and they serve exactly as if elected. The County calls this appointment in lieu of election.","The seat was next due for election in 2020. No contest for it is recorded, and the County lists Castaic Union Trustee Areas A and C among the seats filled by appointment in lieu of election, without naming the appointees (County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"General Election November 3, 2020, Final List of Cancelled Elections: Appointment in Lieu of Election Due to Insufficiency of Candidates\", https://www.lavote.gov/docs/rrcc/election-info/11032020_cancelled-elections.pdf). Whether Michael Owen Lambarth continued is not known."],"noteHit":null}
{"id":28885,"section":"officeHoldings","status":"live","title":"Stacy Dobbs — School Board Member, Castaic Union School District","person":"#28864 Stacy Dobbs","body":"#21596 Castaic Union School District","office":"#26964 School Board Member","seatLabel":"","termStart":"2015-12","termEnd":"2020","selectionMethod":"appointed","howEnded":"resigned","startEvidence":"certified","provenance":"apply_cancelled_2013_2016.php, 3 October 2026: a seat filled by appointment in lieu of election, on the County's list of cancelled elections (decision 6)","hits":["Appointed in lieu of election; no contest was held. The County cancelled the election of November 3, 2015 for the district's two at-large seats for want of candidates; its list of the candidates whose names would not appear on the ballot names Stacy Dobbs and Michael Owen Lambarth, neither of them an incumbent (County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"Local and Municipal Consolidated Elections, November 3, 2015: Final List of Cancelled Elections (Appointment in Lieu of Election Due to Insufficiency of Candidates)\", https://www.lavote.gov/Documents/Election_Info/11032015-CancelledElections.pdf; and County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"Local and Municipal Consolidated Elections, November 3, 2015: Final List of Qualified Candidates Whose Name Will Not Appear on the Ballot\", September 1, 2015, https://www.lavote.gov/Documents/Election_Info/11032015_CandidatesNotOnBallot.pdf).","Elections Code, section 10515: where no more candidates file than there are seats, the Board of Supervisors appoints them, and they serve exactly as if elected. The County calls this appointment in lieu of election.","The seat was next due for election in 2020. No contest for it is recorded, and the County lists Castaic Union Trustee Areas A and C among the seats filled by appointment in lieu of election, without naming the appointees (County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"General Election November 3, 2020, Final List of Cancelled Elections: Appointment in Lieu of Election Due to Insufficiency of Candidates\", https://www.lavote.gov/docs/rrcc/election-info/11032020_cancelled-elections.pdf). Whether Stacy Dobbs continued is not known.","She resigned before the 2020 election: Trustee Area A was \"previously filled by Stacy Dobbs before Dobbs resigned,\" according to the district (\"School Board Elections in 3 SCV Districts Canceled,\" SCVNews.com, 2 October 2020, https://scvnews.com/school-board-elections-in-3-scv-districts-canceled). The date of the resignation is not given."],"noteHit":null}
{"id":28883,"section":"officeHoldings","status":"live","title":"Denis DeFigueiredo — School Board Member, Sulphur Springs Union School District","person":"#28330 Denis DeFigueiredo","body":"#21594 Sulphur Springs Union School District","office":"#26964 School Board Member","seatLabel":"Trustee Area 2","termStart":"2015-12","termEnd":"2020-12","selectionMethod":"appointed","howEnded":"reelected","startEvidence":"certified","provenance":"apply_cancelled_2013_2016.php, 3 October 2026: a seat filled by appointment in lieu of election, on the County's list of cancelled elections (decision 6)","hits":["Appointed in lieu of election; no contest was held. The County cancelled the election of November 3, 2015 for Trustee Areas 1 and 2 for want of candidates; its list of the candidates whose names would not appear on the ballot names Denis F. DeFigueiredo, the incumbent, for Trustee Area 2 (County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"Local and Municipal Consolidated Elections, November 3, 2015: Final List of Cancelled Elections (Appointment in Lieu of Election Due to Insufficiency of Candidates)\", https://www.lavote.gov/Documents/Election_Info/11032015-CancelledElections.pdf; and County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"Local and Municipal Consolidated Elections, November 3, 2015: Final List of Qualified Candidates Whose Name Will Not Appear on the Ballot\", September 1, 2015, https://www.lavote.gov/Documents/Election_Info/11032015_CandidatesNotOnBallot.pdf).","Elections Code, section 10515: where no more candidates file than there are seats, the Board of Supervisors appoints them, and they serve exactly as if elected. The County calls this appointment in lieu of election.","The seat was next due for election in 2020. No contest for it is recorded, and the County lists Trustee Area 2 among the seats filled by appointment in lieu of election, without naming the appointees (County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"General Election November 3, 2020, Final List of Cancelled Elections: Appointment in Lieu of Election Due to Insufficiency of Candidates\", https://www.lavote.gov/docs/rrcc/election-info/11032020_cancelled-elections.pdf). Whether Denis DeFigueiredo continued is not known.","Returned without a contest in 2020: the County's final list of cancelled elections for 3 November 2020 names \"Sulphur Springs Union Elementary (Trustee Area 1, 2, and 3 U/T ending 12/22)\" (County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, General Election November 3, 2020, Final List of Cancelled Elections)."],"noteHit":null}
{"id":28881,"section":"officeHoldings","status":"live","title":"Victor Torres — School Board Member, Castaic Union School District","person":"#28376 Victor Torres","body":"#21596 Castaic Union School District","office":"#26964 School Board Member","seatLabel":"","termStart":"2013-12","termEnd":"2017-02-17","selectionMethod":"appointed","howEnded":"resigned","startEvidence":"certified","provenance":"apply_cancelled_2013_2016.php, 3 October 2026: a seat filled by appointment in lieu of election, on the County's list of cancelled elections (decision 6)","hits":["Appointed in lieu of election; no contest was held. The County cancelled the election of November 5, 2013 for the district's three at-large seats for want of candidates; its list of the candidates whose names would not appear on the ballot names Victor M. Torres, the incumbent, with Susan M. Christopher and Laura L. Pearson (County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"Local and Municipal Consolidated Elections, November 5, 2013: Final List, Cancelled Elections (Appointment in Lieu of Election Because of an Insufficient Number of Candidates)\", https://www.lavote.gov/Documents/Election_Info/11052013_canc_elec.pdf; and County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"Local and Municipal Consolidated Elections, November 5, 2013: Final List of Qualified Candidates Whose Name Will Not Appear on the Ballot\", August 20, 2013, https://www.lavote.gov/Documents/Election_Info/11052013_final_list_of_qualified_candidates_whose_name_will_not_appear_on_the_ballot.pdf).","Elections Code, section 10515: where no more candidates file than there are seats, the Board of Supervisors appoints them, and they serve exactly as if elected. The County calls this appointment in lieu of election.","The seat was next due for election in 2018. No contest for it is recorded, and the County lists seats of this board among those filled by appointment in lieu of election, without naming the appointees (County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"General Election November 6, 2018, Final List of Cancelled Elections: Appointment in Lieu of Election Due to Insufficiency of Candidates\", https://www.lavote.gov/docs/rrcc/Election-Info/11082018_final-list-cancelled-elections.pdf). Whether Victor Torres continued is not known."],"noteHit":null}
{"id":28807,"section":"officeHoldings","status":"live","title":"Chris Fall — School Board Member, William S. Hart Union High School District","person":"#28721 Chris Fall","body":"#21588 William S. Hart Union High School District","office":"#26964 School Board Member","seatLabel":"","termStart":"2013-06-05","termEnd":"2013-08-16","selectionMethod":"appointed","howEnded":"resigned","startEvidence":"roster","provenance":"create_hart_early_members.php, 3 October 2026: a tenure from Leon Worden's Hart board roster, hartschoolboardmembers.htm","hits":["The County's list of the candidates whose names would not appear on the ballot at the election of November 5, 2013, dated August 20, 2013, names Chris A. Fall, \"Appointed Incumbent\", filed August 7, 2013, among the three candidates for the Hart district's at-large seats, whose election the County cancelled for want of candidates (County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"Local and Municipal Consolidated Elections, November 5, 2013: Final List, Cancelled Elections (Appointment in Lieu of Election Because of an Insufficient Number of Candidates)\", https://www.lavote.gov/Documents/Election_Info/11052013_canc_elec.pdf; and County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"Local and Municipal Consolidated Elections, November 5, 2013: Final List of Qualified Candidates Whose Name Will Not Appear on the Ballot\", August 20, 2013, https://www.lavote.gov/Documents/Election_Info/11052013_final_list_of_qualified_candidates_whose_name_will_not_appear_on_the_ballot.pdf). The list is dated four days after the resignation the roster records."],"noteHit":null}
{"id":28580,"section":"officeHoldings","status":"live","title":"Bob Jensen — School Board Member, William S. Hart Union High School District","person":"#28322 Bob Jensen","body":"#21588 William S. Hart Union High School District","office":"#26964 School Board Member","seatLabel":"","termStart":"2013-12","termEnd":"2018-12","selectionMethod":"appointed","howEnded":"reelected","startEvidence":"certified","provenance":"derive_board_holdings.php, 3 October 2026: a seat filled without a vote, inferred (decision 5)","hits":["No contest for the seat is recorded at the election of 2013: the seat was filled without a vote. Elections Code, section 10515: where no more candidates file than there are seats, the Board of Supervisors appoints them, and they serve exactly as if elected. The County calls this appointment in lieu of election.","Appointed in lieu of election; no contest was held. The County cancelled the election of November 5, 2013 for the Hart district's three at-large seats for want of candidates; its list of the candidates whose names would not appear on the ballot names Bob Jensen, the incumbent, with Joe Messina and Chris A. Fall (County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"Local and Municipal Consolidated Elections, November 5, 2013: Final List, Cancelled Elections (Appointment in Lieu of Election Because of an Insufficient Number of Candidates)\", https://www.lavote.gov/Documents/Election_Info/11052013_canc_elec.pdf; and County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"Local and Municipal Consolidated Elections, November 5, 2013: Final List of Qualified Candidates Whose Name Will Not Appear on the Ballot\", August 20, 2013, https://www.lavote.gov/Documents/Election_Info/11052013_final_list_of_qualified_candidates_whose_name_will_not_appear_on_the_ballot.pdf)."],"noteHit":null}
{"id":28543,"section":"officeHoldings","status":"live","title":"Victor Torres — School Board Member, Castaic Union School District","person":"#28376 Victor Torres","body":"#21596 Castaic Union School District","office":"#26964 School Board Member","seatLabel":"","termStart":"2009-12","termEnd":"2013-12","selectionMethod":"elected","howEnded":"reelected","startEvidence":"roster","provenance":"derive_board_holdings.php, 3 October 2026: a term from the election results","hits":["The seat was next due for election on November 5, 2013. The County cancelled that election for the district's three at-large seats for want of candidates, and its list of the candidates whose names would not appear on the ballot names Victor M. Torres, the incumbent, among the three: he continued in the seat, appointed in lieu of election (County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"Local and Municipal Consolidated Elections, November 5, 2013: Final List, Cancelled Elections (Appointment in Lieu of Election Because of an Insufficient Number of Candidates)\", https://www.lavote.gov/Documents/Election_Info/11052013_canc_elec.pdf; and County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"Local and Municipal Consolidated Elections, November 5, 2013: Final List of Qualified Candidates Whose Name Will Not Appear on the Ballot\", August 20, 2013, https://www.lavote.gov/Documents/Election_Info/11052013_final_list_of_qualified_candidates_whose_name_will_not_appear_on_the_ballot.pdf)."],"noteHit":null}
{"id":28503,"section":"officeHoldings","status":"live","title":"Lori MacDonald — School Board Member, Sulphur Springs Union School District","person":"#28356 Lori MacDonald","body":"#21594 Sulphur Springs Union School District","office":"#26964 School Board Member","seatLabel":"","termStart":"2013-12","termEnd":"2018-12","selectionMethod":"elected","howEnded":"reelected","startEvidence":"roster","provenance":"derive_board_holdings.php, 3 October 2026: a term from the election results","hits":["The seat was next due for election in 2018. No contest for it is recorded, and the County lists seats of this board among those filled by appointment in lieu of election, without naming the appointees (County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"General Election November 6, 2018, Final List of Cancelled Elections: Appointment in Lieu of Election Due to Insufficiency of Candidates\", https://www.lavote.gov/docs/rrcc/Election-Info/11082018_final-list-cancelled-elections.pdf). Whether Lori Macdonald continued is not known.","Returned without a contest in 2018. County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"General Election November 6, 2018, Final List of Cancelled Elections,\" https://www.lavote.gov/docs/rrcc/Election-Info/11082018_final-list-cancelled-elections.pdf: \"Sulphur Springs Union School (Trustee Areas 3, 4, and 5)\", the seats filled by appointment in lieu of election."],"noteHit":null}
{"id":28501,"section":"officeHoldings","status":"live","title":"Ken Chase — School Board Member, Sulphur Springs Union School District","person":"#28348 Ken Chase","body":"#21594 Sulphur Springs Union School District","office":"#26964 School Board Member","seatLabel":"","termStart":"2013-12","termEnd":"2018-12","selectionMethod":"elected","howEnded":"reelected","startEvidence":"roster","provenance":"derive_board_holdings.php, 3 October 2026: a term from the election results","hits":["The seat was next due for election in 2018. No contest for it is recorded, and the County lists seats of this board among those filled by appointment in lieu of election, without naming the appointees (County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"General Election November 6, 2018, Final List of Cancelled Elections: Appointment in Lieu of Election Due to Insufficiency of Candidates\", https://www.lavote.gov/docs/rrcc/Election-Info/11082018_final-list-cancelled-elections.pdf). Whether Ken Chase continued is not known.","Returned without a contest in 2018. County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"General Election November 6, 2018, Final List of Cancelled Elections,\" https://www.lavote.gov/docs/rrcc/Election-Info/11082018_final-list-cancelled-elections.pdf: \"Sulphur Springs Union School (Trustee Areas 3, 4, and 5)\", the seats filled by appointment in lieu of election."],"noteHit":null}
{"id":28499,"section":"officeHoldings","status":"live","title":"Denis DeFigueiredo — School Board Member, Sulphur Springs Union School District","person":"#28330 Denis DeFigueiredo","body":"#21594 Sulphur Springs Union School District","office":"#26964 School Board Member","seatLabel":"","termStart":"2011-12","termEnd":"2015-12","selectionMethod":"elected","howEnded":"reelected","startEvidence":"roster","provenance":"derive_board_holdings.php, 3 October 2026: a term from the election results","hits":["The term was due to end in December 2015. The district's next election, on November 3, 2015, was by trustee area, and the County cancelled it for Trustee Areas 1 and 2 for want of candidates; its list of the candidates whose names would not appear on the ballot names Denis F. DeFigueiredo, the incumbent, for Trustee Area 2. The term ended in December 2015, and he continued, appointed in lieu of election (County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"Local and Municipal Consolidated Elections, November 3, 2015: Final List of Cancelled Elections (Appointment in Lieu of Election Due to Insufficiency of Candidates)\", https://www.lavote.gov/Documents/Election_Info/11032015-CancelledElections.pdf; and County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"Local and Municipal Consolidated Elections, November 3, 2015: Final List of Qualified Candidates Whose Name Will Not Appear on the Ballot\", September 1, 2015, https://www.lavote.gov/Documents/Election_Info/11032015_CandidatesNotOnBallot.pdf)."],"noteHit":null}
{"id":28497,"section":"officeHoldings","status":"live","title":"Denis DeFigueiredo — School Board Member, Sulphur Springs Union School District","person":"#28330 Denis DeFigueiredo","body":"#21594 Sulphur Springs Union School District","office":"#26964 School Board Member","seatLabel":"","termStart":"2007-12","termEnd":"2011-12","selectionMethod":"appointed","howEnded":"reelected","startEvidence":"derived","provenance":"derive_board_holdings.php, 3 October 2026: a seat filled without a vote, inferred (decision 5)","hits":["No contest for the seat is recorded at the election of 2007: the seat was filled without a vote. Elections Code, section 10515: where no more candidates file than there are seats, the Board of Supervisors appoints them, and they serve exactly as if elected. The County calls this appointment in lieu of election."],"noteHit":null}
{"id":28489,"section":"officeHoldings","status":"live","title":"Matthew Watson — School Board Member, Saugus Union School District","person":"#28358 Matthew Watson","body":"#21592 Saugus Union School District","office":"#26964 School Board Member","seatLabel":"Trustee Area 4","termStart":"2024-12","termEnd":"2028-12","selectionMethod":"appointed","howEnded":"serving","startEvidence":"derived","provenance":"derive_board_holdings.php, 3 October 2026: a seat filled without a vote, inferred (decision 5)","hits":["No contest for the seat is recorded at the election of 2024 (County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"General Election November 5, 2024, Final List of Cancelled Elections: Appointment in Lieu of Election Due to Insufficiency of Candidates\", https://content.lavote.gov/docs/rrcc/documents/cancelled-elections-november-2024.pdf): the seat was filled without a vote. Elections Code, section 10515: where no more candidates file than there are seats, the Board of Supervisors appoints them, and they serve exactly as if elected. The County calls this appointment in lieu of election.","The district's board page lists Matthew Watson for Trustee Area 4 (Saugus Union School District, \"Governing Board\", https://www.saugususd.org/governing-board, read 3 October 2026), and the County's list of elections cancelled in November 2024 includes Saugus Union Trustee Area 4 (County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"General Election November 5, 2024, Final List of Cancelled Elections: Appointment in Lieu of Election Due to Insufficiency of Candidates\", https://content.lavote.gov/docs/rrcc/documents/cancelled-elections-november-2024.pdf)."],"noteHit":null}
{"id":28487,"section":"officeHoldings","status":"live","title":"Matthew Watson — School Board Member, Saugus Union School District","person":"#28358 Matthew Watson","body":"#21592 Saugus Union School District","office":"#26964 School Board Member","seatLabel":"Trustee Area 4","termStart":"2020-12","termEnd":"2024-12","selectionMethod":"elected","howEnded":"reelected","startEvidence":"roster","provenance":"derive_board_holdings.php, 3 October 2026: a term from the election results","hits":["No contest for the seat is recorded at the next election, in 2024, and the County lists it among the seats filled without a vote (County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"General Election November 5, 2024, Final List of Cancelled Elections: Appointment in Lieu of Election Due to Insufficiency of Candidates\", https://content.lavote.gov/docs/rrcc/documents/cancelled-elections-november-2024.pdf): Matthew Watson continued in it, as the district's board page shows."],"noteHit":null}
{"id":28473,"section":"officeHoldings","status":"live","title":"Cassandra Nicole Love — School Board Member, Saugus Union School District","person":"#28324 Cassandra Nicole Love","body":"#21592 Saugus Union School District","office":"#26964 School Board Member","seatLabel":"Trustee Area 1","termStart":"2022-12","termEnd":"2023-10-02","selectionMethod":"elected","howEnded":"resigned","startEvidence":"roster","provenance":"derive_board_holdings.php, 3 October 2026: a term from the election results","hits":["Patti Garibay holds Trustee Area 1 on the district's board page (Saugus Union School District, \"Governing Board\", https://www.saugususd.org/governing-board, read 3 October 2026), and the County's list of elections cancelled in November 2024 includes an unexpired term for Area 1 ending in December 2026 (County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"General Election November 5, 2024, Final List of Cancelled Elections: Appointment in Lieu of Election Due to Insufficiency of Candidates\", https://content.lavote.gov/docs/rrcc/documents/cancelled-elections-november-2024.pdf). This term ended early; when, and how, is not recorded."],"noteHit":null}
{"id":28461,"section":"officeHoldings","status":"live","title":"Philip Ellis Jr. — School Board Member, Newhall School District","person":"#28364 Philip Ellis Jr.","body":"#21590 Newhall School District","office":"#26964 School Board Member","seatLabel":"","termStart":"2013-12","termEnd":"2018-12","selectionMethod":"elected","howEnded":"expired","startEvidence":"roster","provenance":"derive_board_holdings.php, 3 October 2026: a term from the election results","hits":["The seat was next due for election in 2018. No contest for it is recorded, and the County lists seats of this board among those filled by appointment in lieu of election, without naming the appointees (County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"General Election November 6, 2018, Final List of Cancelled Elections: Appointment in Lieu of Election Due to Insufficiency of Candidates\", https://www.lavote.gov/docs/rrcc/Election-Info/11082018_final-list-cancelled-elections.pdf). Whether Philip Ellis Jr. continued is not known."],"noteHit":null}
{"id":28264,"section":"officeHoldings","status":"live","title":"Brian Walters — School Board Member, Newhall School District","person":"#25391 Brian Walters","body":"#21590 Newhall School District","office":"#26964 School Board Member","seatLabel":"","termStart":"2009-12","termEnd":"2022-12","selectionMethod":"appointed","howEnded":"expired","startEvidence":"retrospective","provenance":"build_walters_profile.php, 3 October 2026","hits":["County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"General Election November 6, 2018, Final List of Cancelled Elections: Appointment in Lieu of Election Due to Insufficiency of Candidates\", https://www.lavote.gov/docs/rrcc/Election-Info/11082018_final-list-cancelled-elections.pdf: Newhall School, Trustee Areas 1, 3 and 4. He held Trustee Area 1 from 2018; before then the board was elected at large."],"noteHit":null}
{"id":28249,"section":"officeHoldings","status":"live","title":"Michael Shapiro — School Board Member, Newhall School District","person":"#25387 Michael Shapiro","body":"#21590 Newhall School District","office":"#26964 School Board Member","seatLabel":"","termStart":"2003-12","termEnd":"2016-08-01","selectionMethod":"elected","howEnded":"resigned","startEvidence":"retrospective","provenance":"create_office_gap_holdings.php, 3 October 2026","hits":["The County cancelled the election of November 3, 2015 for want of candidates, and its list of the candidates whose names would not appear on the ballot names Michael R. Shapiro, the incumbent, for Trustee Area 4: appointed in lieu of election, no contest was held (County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"Local and Municipal Consolidated Elections, November 3, 2015: Final List of Cancelled Elections (Appointment in Lieu of Election Due to Insufficiency of Candidates)\", https://www.lavote.gov/Documents/Election_Info/11032015-CancelledElections.pdf; and County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"Local and Municipal Consolidated Elections, November 3, 2015: Final List of Qualified Candidates Whose Name Will Not Appear on the Ballot\", September 1, 2015, https://www.lavote.gov/Documents/Election_Info/11032015_CandidatesNotOnBallot.pdf)."],"noteHit":null}
{"id":28247,"section":"officeHoldings","status":"live","title":"Susan Christopher — School Board Member, Castaic Union School District","person":"#25381 Susan Christopher","body":"#21596 Castaic Union School District","office":"#26964 School Board Member","seatLabel":"","termStart":"2009-12","termEnd":"2018-12","selectionMethod":"elected","howEnded":"expired","startEvidence":"retrospective","provenance":"create_office_gap_holdings.php, 3 October 2026","hits":["The County cancelled the election of November 5, 2013 for want of candidates, and its list of the candidates whose names would not appear on the ballot names Susan M. Christopher, the incumbent, among the appointees for the district's three at-large seats: appointed in lieu of election, no contest was held (County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"Local and Municipal Consolidated Elections, November 5, 2013: Final List, Cancelled Elections (Appointment in Lieu of Election Because of an Insufficient Number of Candidates)\", https://www.lavote.gov/Documents/Election_Info/11052013_canc_elec.pdf; and County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"Local and Municipal Consolidated Elections, November 5, 2013: Final List of Qualified Candidates Whose Name Will Not Appear on the Ballot\", August 20, 2013, https://www.lavote.gov/Documents/Election_Info/11052013_final_list_of_qualified_candidates_whose_name_will_not_appear_on_the_ballot.pdf)."],"noteHit":null}
{"id":28245,"section":"officeHoldings","status":"live","title":"Joe Messina — School Board Member, William S. Hart Union High School District","person":"#26549 Joe Messina","body":"#21588 William S. Hart Union High School District","office":"#26964 School Board Member","seatLabel":"","termStart":"2009-12","termEnd":"2022-12","selectionMethod":"elected","howEnded":"reelected","startEvidence":"retrospective","provenance":"create_office_gap_holdings.php, 3 October 2026","hits":["Ballotpedia, \"Joe Messina - Ballotpedia\", https://ballotpedia.org/Joe_Messina: \"Joe Messina ran against two other candidates, including fellow incumbents Paul B. Strickland and Bob Jensen for three seats in the general election on November 5, 2013. The election has been canceled and will not appear on the official ballot.\"","The County cancelled the election of November 5, 2013 for want of candidates, and its list of the candidates whose names would not appear on the ballot names Joe Messina, the incumbent, among the appointees for the district's three at-large seats, with Bob Jensen and Chris A. Fall: appointed in lieu of election, no contest was held (County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"Local and Municipal Consolidated Elections, November 5, 2013: Final List, Cancelled Elections (Appointment in Lieu of Election Because of an Insufficient Number of Candidates)\", https://www.lavote.gov/Documents/Election_Info/11052013_canc_elec.pdf; and County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"Local and Municipal Consolidated Elections, November 5, 2013: Final List of Qualified Candidates Whose Name Will Not Appear on the Ballot\", August 20, 2013, https://www.lavote.gov/Documents/Election_Info/11052013_final_list_of_qualified_candidates_whose_name_will_not_appear_on_the_ballot.pdf)."],"noteHit":null}
