{"id":28205,"section":"officeHoldings","status":"live","title":"Christopher Trunkey — School Board Member, Saugus Union School District","person":"#25409 Christopher Trunkey","body":"#21592 Saugus Union School District","office":"#26964 School Board Member","seatLabel":"","termStart":"2014-11-18","termEnd":"","selectionMethod":"appointed","howEnded":"serving","startEvidence":"contemporary","provenance":"build_trunkey_profile.php, 3 October 2026","hits":["Trustee Area 5 is the seat he has held since December 2016: the County cancelled the election of November 8, 2016 for the Area 5 term ending in December 2018 for want of candidates, and its list of the candidates whose names would not appear on the ballot names Chris Trunkey, \"Appointed Incumbent\", for it, appointed in lieu of election (County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"General Election, November 8, 2016: Final List of Cancelled Elections, Appointment in Lieu of Election Due to Insufficiency of Candidates\", https://www.lavote.gov/Documents/Election_Info/11082016-Cancelled-Elections.pdf; and County of Los Angeles, Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, \"2016 General Election: Final List of Qualified Candidates Whose Name Will Not Appear on the Ballot\", September 2, 2016, https://www.lavote.gov/Documents/Election_Info/11082016-final-list-qualified-candidates-who-will-not-appear-on-the-ballot.pdf). He won the seat at the elections of 2018 and 2022 (CEDA 2018 and 2022, and the district's page). His 2014 appointment filled an at-large seat."],"noteHit":null}
{"id":27410,"section":"officeHoldings","status":"live","title":"Jason Gibbs — City Council Member, The City of Santa Clarita","person":"#23091 Jason Gibbs","body":"#394 The City of Santa Clarita","office":"#18327 City Council Member","seatLabel":"District 3","termStart":"2024-12","termEnd":"2028-12","selectionMethod":"appointed","howEnded":"serving","startEvidence":"certified","provenance":"fix_gibbs_current_term.php, 2 October 2026","hits":["County of Los Angeles Registrar-Recorder/County Clerk, final list of cancelled elections, November 5, 2024, https://content.lavote.gov/docs/rrcc/documents/cancelled-elections-november-2024.pdf: \"Santa Clarita (Council District 3)\" is listed under \"appointment in lieu of election due to insufficiency of candidates.\" He was the only candidate, so no vote was taken and he was appointed to the seat."],"noteHit":null}


